    "scientific_rationale": "While Random Forest achieves high agreement on the training and validation sets, its held-out test F1-score is comparable to the deterministic Lee 5x5 Dual-AND Otsu baseline. Random Forest exhibits susceptibility to cross-temporal domain shifts between pre-monsoon low flow and peak flood conditions. Following strict scientific governance, the deterministic physical method is retained as the primary operational baseline, while Random Forest is designated as an advanced candidate probability and uncertainty layer for Phase 7B Explainable AI."
